{"headword":"עָמָל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Job 4:8\" href=\"/Job.4.8\">Jb 4:8</a></sup> <strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 10:15\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.10.15\">Ec 10:15</a> (against Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 113</sup>, v. Kö<sup>Synt. § 249 m</sup>) <strong>trouble, labour, toil (</strong>on this form as abstr. v. Lag<sup>BN 143</sup> Ba<sup>NB 105</sup><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:21\" href=\"/Numbers.23.21\">Nu 23:21</a> +; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמַל</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:16\" href=\"/Judges.10.16\">Ju 10:16</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמָלִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:51\" href=\"/Genesis.41.51\">Gn 41:51</a> +, etc.;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>trouble</em> (‖ <em>sorrow</em>): one’s own suffering, <span dir=\"rtl\">עָמָל וְיָגוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:18\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.18\">Je 20:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ וָכַעַם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:14\" href=\"/Psalms.10.14\">ψ 10:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֳנִי וע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 26:7\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.26.7\">Dt 26:7</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 25:18\" href=\"/Psalms.25.18\">ψ 25:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ וָאָ֑וֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:10\" href=\"/Psalms.90.10\">90:10</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָוֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 23:21\" href=\"/Numbers.23.21\">Nu 23:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:6\" href=\"/Job.5.6\">Jb 5:6</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שָֽׁוְא</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 7:3\" href=\"/Job.7.3\">Jb 7:3</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ נפשׁו</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 53:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.53.11\">Is 53:11</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ בְּעֵינָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:16\" href=\"/Psalms.73.16\">ψ 73:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיַּסְתֵּר ע׳ מֵעֵינָ֑י</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 3:10\" href=\"/Job.3.10\">Jb 3:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְנַחֲמֵי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 16:2\" href=\"/Job.16.2\">16:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אדם לע׳ יוּלָּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">5:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בע׳ אנושׁ אינימוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 73:5\" href=\"/Psalms.73.5\">ψ 73:5</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁכח ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 11:16\" href=\"/Job.11.16\">Jb 11:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַשַּׁנִי ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 41:51\" href=\"/Genesis.41.51\">Gn 41:51</a> (E); <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ לא זכר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:7\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.7\">Pr 31:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תקצר נפשׁו בע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 10:16\" href=\"/Judges.10.16\">Ju 10:16</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>trouble, mischief</em>, as done to others: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שֹׁד</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.2\">Pr 24:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹצֵר ע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 94:20\" href=\"/Psalms.94.20\">ψ 94:20</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָע</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:13\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.13\">Hb 1:13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָשׁוּב ע׳ בְרֹאשׁוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:17\" href=\"/Psalms.7.17\">ψ 7:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ע׳ וָאָ֑וֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:7\" href=\"/Psalms.10.7\">10:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">און וע׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:11\" href=\"/Psalms.55.11\">55:11</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אָוֶן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:1\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.1\">Is 10:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.4\">59:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 1:3\" href=\"/Habakkuk.1.3\">Hb 1:3</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 7:15\" href=\"/Psalms.7.15\">ψ 7:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 4:8\" href=\"/Job.4.8\">Jb 4:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 15:35\" href=\"/Job.15.35\">15:35</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">עֲמַל שְׂפָתֵימוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 140:10\" href=\"/Psalms.140.10\">ψ 140:10</a> <em>mischief of their lips</em>."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>toil, labour</em> (late in Heb.): <a data-ref=\"Ecclesiastes 2:10\" href=\"/Ecclesiastes.2.10\">Ec 2:10</a><sup>(×2)</